          "line": 260,
          "message": "AC-05 lacks a test proving that an allowlisted error.type is preserved; the existing test only checks omission of a non-allowlisted type.",
          "confidence": 0.96,
          "category": "testing",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "AC-05 calls for preserving an approved error.type when it passes the existing allowlist. The named pipeline test checks that InvalidOperationException is omitted, but never exercises an allowlisted type.",
            "failureScenario": "If the implementation stops exporting all error.type values, the current test still passes, even when an approved exception type should be preserved."
